# Step 2 — declare the grain

## Say it as a sentence

> **one row per product per order** = one **order line**

- Not "per order" (hides products) · not "per day" (an aggregate)

## Choose the **finest** grain the source allows

- Atomic = **maximum flexibility**
- Roll **up** to any summary later · never roll **down**
- Capture detail now → future questions stay answerable

## Why it must precede steps 3 & 4

- The grain is the **contract** the next steps are held to
- **Dimensions** — only things true *at the order-line level*
- **Facts** — only measures meaningful *per order line*
- **One grain per fact table** — never mix lines and totals
